    <string name="about_upstream_project">Upstream Project</string>
    <string name="accessibility_clipboard_description">Lets AirSync notice when you copy text in other apps so it can send it to your paired Mac, even while AirSync is in the background. AirSync only reacts to copy actions and reads the clipboard at that moment. It does not read screen content, record what you type, or collect any other data. Clipboard text is sent only to your own paired Mac over your encrypted local connection and is never uploaded to any server.</string>
